            "]]],["text","
            "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","
              Keeping a property in good order can be difficult when life is
              busy. Small issues are easy to postpone; maintenance requests can
              be unclear; and a repair can involve an occupant, a property
              manager, access arrangements and an approval process. Ellis
              Services Group exists to make that first step more
              straightforward.
            "]]],["text","
            "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","
