            "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","For a homeowner, that may mean describing a leak, blocked drain, power concern, fixture issue or a planned upgrade. For a property manager or real-estate agency, it can mean keeping the address, occupant notes, access arrangements, work-order reference and approval pathway together from the outset."]]],["text","
