          "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h1",[],[["text","Blocked Drains Perth — Drain Clearing & Repairs"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","aside",[["","class","intent-safety"],["","data-intent-safety",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","strong",[],[["text","Wastewater overflow needs the right first call."]]],["text"," Water Corporation directs customers with wastewater overflowing on their property to call "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","tel:131375"]],[["text","13 13 75"]]],["text"," immediately. Private plumbing and a public sewer fault have different repair responsibilities. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","https://www.watercorporation.com.au/Help-and-advice/Water-issues/Wastewater/Sewer-blockage-or-overflow"],["","rel","noopener noreferrer"],["","target","_blank"]],[["text","Check the official overflow guidance"]]],["text","."]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Book a Perth plumber for a blocked drain, slow sink, backed-up shower or blocked toilet. Ellis Services Group investigates the affected drainage, explains the clearing or repair scope and provides a written quote. Our Perth team handles drainage requests for homes, rental properties and managed premises."]]],["text","
