"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","No hot water, an unreliable shower temperature or a leaking hot-water unit? Ellis Services Group provides hot-water repairs and replacement assessments across Perth. Our local plumbing and electrical team investigates the fault, explains the practical repair options and provides a written quote before the agreed work proceeds."]]],["text","
