"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section service-editorial"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","nav",[["","aria-label","On this service page"],["","class","service-jump-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-work"]],[["text","Services"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-method"]],[["text","Repair & installation"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-quote"]],[["text","Costs & quote"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-faq"]],[["text","FAQs"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-booking"]],[["text","Book a visit"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","aside",[["","class","service-answer"],["","data-service-answer",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","What to do next"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Tell us whether one outlet or the whole property has lost hot water, and whether temperature or flow has changed. Do not remove equipment covers or touch wiring; keep clear of water near electrical equipment. Plumbing connections and electrical heating components may need different trades. We assess the system and explain the repair options. If replacement is considered, the quote separately identifies equipment, connections and installation requirements rather than assuming a new unit will suit."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-hot-water-plumbing-or-electrical.html"]],[["text","Hot-water problem: plumbing or electrical?"]]],["text",". "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html?service=hot-water-problems-perth.html"]],[["text","Request an assessment and written quote"]]],["text","."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-work"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Hot-water repair services for Perth homes and managed properties"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","No hot water or supply that runs out early"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A complete loss of hot water and a system that heats but cannot keep up are different service requests. We establish which outlets are affected, whether the change is constant or intermittent, and the type of equipment serving the property. This helps focus the assessment on the unit and supply rather than replacing parts on the basis of one symptom."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Temperature, pressure and leaking connections"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","We assess inconsistent temperature, reduced hot-water flow and visible leaks around accessible connections. A problem at one shower can have a different scope from a problem affecting every hot tap. The repair plan distinguishes the hot-water equipment from local fixtures, pipework and connections so you can see what work is actually needed."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Plumbing and electrical work through one Perth team"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Where a hot-water fault involves electrical components as well as water connections, we coordinate the relevant licensed trades within the agreed job. Tell us the system location and any readable model information; you do not need to identify the failed component. See our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-hot-water-plumbing-or-electrical.html"]],[["text","hot-water plumbing and electrical fault guide"]]],["text"," for the distinction."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","figure",[["","class","service-editorial-figure"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","img",[["","alt","Plumbing service illustration showing drain access beside hot-water equipment"],["","class","service-editorial-image"],["","height","941"],["","loading","lazy"],["","sizes","(max-width: 540px) calc(100vw - 48px), 480px"],["","src","hot-water-drainage-perth.png"],["","srcset","hot-water-drainage-perth-480.webp 480w, hot-water-drainage-perth-960.webp 960w"],["","width","1672"]],[]]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-method"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","How we assess and complete your hot-water repair"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Our visit starts with the reported loss of service, the equipment location and safe access to the installation. We inspect the relevant connections and investigate the reported fault. Before repair work, we explain the findings, the proposed parts or connection work, and any access or additional trade requirements that affect the scope."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Repair or replace the hot-water system?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Repair is assessed against the condition of the existing installation, the identified fault and compatible parts. Replacement is a separate option when the equipment condition or required work makes a repair unsuitable. We discuss the property requirements and proposed replacement connections before quoting; a larger system or different equipment is not assumed to fit the existing installation."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","For an approved repair or replacement, the agreed scope includes the relevant connection work and checks for that work. We explain what has been completed and any remaining issues identified during the visit. If the visible leak appears to come from another pipe or fixture, our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","water-leak-detection-perth.html"]],[["text","water leak detection service"]]],["text"," is the appropriate related starting point."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-trade-note"]],[["text","Our Perth plumbing and electrical work is carried out by appropriately licensed trades. Licence details are available on request."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-safety"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","strong",[],[["text","Safety:"]]],["text"," Do not remove covers, touch wiring or approach water near electrical equipment. Keep clear of a hazardous unit. For immediate danger, Call 000."]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:start "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-content"],["","data-keyword-gap",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","gap-hot-water-replacement"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Hot-water system replacement in Perth: compare the complete scope"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Compare repair and replacement options for the reported hot-water problem. Before choosing replacement, compare the condition of the existing system and the agreed repair option with the proposed equipment and connection work. A loss of hot water alone does not establish that the unit must be replaced."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","For a replacement quote, confirm product supply, removal of the old unit, plumbing connections, any fixed electrical work and the checks included for that work. Access changes and restoration of finishes should be identified separately. The existing price range is a guide for a standard package, not a universal price for every system or property."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","State the system type if safely known. Gas, heat-pump, refrigeration and manufacturer-specific tasks still need the relevant capability confirmed; this comparison does not expand the accepted specialist service range."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-hot-water-plumbing-or-electrical.html"]],[["text","Is the hot-water problem plumbing or electrical?"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","fixtures-appliances-perth.html"]],[["text","Product compatibility and connection planning"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","faq.html"]],[["text","Written quote inclusions and additional approval"]]]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","learn-about-hot-water-problems-perth"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Hot water repairs Perth: symptoms and service choices"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Sudden loss of hot water"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A supply, heating, control or plumbing fault may be involved. Report the system type and whether every hot outlet is affected. Do not open the unit, reset protection repeatedly or assume the system must be replaced. Gas and heat-pump specialist work requires separate confirmation."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Hot water at taps but not the shower"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A local fitting or mixing problem may differ from a system-wide loss of heating. Tell us which outlets work and when the temperature changes. The pattern guides assessment but does not establish the component or trade required."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Electric hot-water systems and safety-switch trips"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A fault in the heater or associated electrical installation can cause a trip. The timing is useful for assessment, but it does not identify the failed part. Do not bypass protection; the appropriate plumbing and electrical work is confirmed after investigation."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-hot-water-plumbing-or-electrical.html"]],[["text","Separate plumbing and electrical hot-water checks"]]]]]]]]]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:end "]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section service-quote"],["","id","service-quote"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Hot-water repair and replacement costs in Perth"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","aria-labelledby","ellis-price-guide"],["","class","price-guide"]],[["text","
