                "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[["","id","ellis-price-guide"]],[["text","Hot-water price guide"]]],["text","
                "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","
                  A practical guide for standard hot-water repair and
                  replacement work at a Perth property.
                "]]],["text","
              "]]],["text","
              "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","price-guide__grid"]],[["text","
                "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","article",[["","class","price-guide__item"]],[["text","
                  "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Hot-water repair"]]],["text","
                  "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","price-guide__range"]],[["text","AUD $198–$660"]]],["text","
                  "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","price-guide__unit"]],[["text","per repair · incl. GST"]]],["text","
                "]]],["text","
                "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","article",[["","class","price-guide__item"]],[["text","
                  "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","System replacement"]]],["text","
                  "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","price-guide__range"]],[["text","AUD $1,980–$4,950"]]],["text","
                  "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","price-guide__unit"]],[["text","per package · incl. GST"]]],["text","
                "]]],["text","
              "]]],["text","
              "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","price-guide__notice"]],[["text","
                "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","strong",[],[["text","Guide conditions:"]]],["text"," These AUD ranges are for
                standard-hours, standard-scope work and are incl. GST. Access,
                materials, extra pipe, cable or circuit work, compliance work,
                emergency or after-hours work and unforeseen repairs are
                confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.
              "]]],["text","
            "]]],["text","
          "]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","What your written quote covers"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The system type, symptoms, affected fixtures and access help define whether the work concerns the water connections, temperature or supply, or an electrical component. Repairs and replacement are separate scopes. Equipment, connection changes and any additional trade work are identified in the written quote for the property."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The final written quote sets out the work included, materials and any agreed additional tasks. We explain changes to the scope before extra work proceeds. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html?service=hot-water-problems-perth.html"]],[["text","Request a hot-water repair quote"]]],["text","."]]]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section faq service-editorial-faq"],["","id","service-faq"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Hot Water Repairs & System Replacement Perth FAQs"]]],["comment"," site-intent:start "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","intent-content"],["","data-site-intent",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","No hot water: assess the system and the affected outlets"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Loss of hot water at one outlet may need a different assessment from a whole-property failure. Plumbing connections, an electrical supply problem and equipment faults are distinct possibilities. Describe the system type if safely known. Gas, heat-pump, refrigerant or manufacturer-specific work requires the relevant scope and capability to be confirmed; a hot-water enquiry is not approval for every system type."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-hot-water-plumbing-or-electrical.html"]],[["text","Plumbing or electrical hot-water problem?"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","fixtures-appliances-perth.html"]],[["text","Connection and replacement scope"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","faq.html"]],[["text","Booking and quote questions"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","water-pressure-perth.html"]],[["text","Low Water Pressure & Water Hammer Perth"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","emergency-plumber-perth.html"]],[["text","24-Hour Emergency Plumber Perth"]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Can I buy a new hot-water unit before the assessment?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","You can ask about a proposed product, but do not assume it suits the existing supply, connections or installation location. Confirm equipment compatibility, required trades and the full installation scope before purchase or approval."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Are gas and heat-pump systems automatically included?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","No. Give the system type and proposed task. Any gas, refrigeration or other specialist component must be checked against the appropriate service capability and authorisation before work is accepted."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Why has my hot water suddenly stopped working?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Several supply, heating or plumbing faults can interrupt hot water. The system type and affected outlets guide assessment. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#learn-about-hot-water-problems-perth"]],[["text","Read the explanation."]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Why is there hot water at some taps but not at the shower?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A shower-only temperature problem can involve its fitting or mixing arrangement rather than failure of the whole heater. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#learn-about-hot-water-problems-perth"]],[["text","Read the explanation."]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Why might an electric hot water system trip a safety switch?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A heater or its electrical supply may be faulty. Do not bypass the safety switch or keep resetting it. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#learn-about-hot-water-problems-perth"]],[["text","Read the explanation."]]]]]]]]],["comment"," site-intent:end "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Do I need to diagnose the problem first?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","No. Describe the observable change and property context. We inspect the affected area on site to establish the cause and confirm the repair scope. If more access is needed, we agree it with you first."]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Can I send photos?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Photos are optional: email safely taken photos to maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com. You can contact us without photos. Do not approach a hazard, remove covers or dismantle equipment to take a photo."]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Is a hot-water problem plumbing or electrical?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","It can be either, depending on the system and symptom. Describe the issue rather than trying to diagnose it yourself."]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","What should I send with a hot-water enquiry?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Include the property address, unit location, what changed, affected fixtures and any safely readable unit information."]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Can I remove the cover to check the unit?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","No. Do not remove covers or handle wiring."]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Can you assess repair and replacement options at the same visit?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","We assess the existing system and explain the repair scope. If replacement needs to be considered, we discuss equipment and connection requirements as a separate option in the written quote. No replacement is assumed from the initial enquiry."]]]]]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section contact-band service-booking"],["","id","service-booking"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Book hot-water repair in Perth"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Include the suburb, unit location, change in supply and whether one or all outlets are affected. For rentals, add the property manager, access contact and work-order reference. We serve Thornlie within our Southern Suburbs coverage as well as the other Perth regions. Our local team covers "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","service-areas.html"]],[["text","all six Perth service regions"]]],["text"," from our office at 140 St Georges Terrace, Perth WA 6000."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Call to discuss the work or send the property details through our enquiry form. You do not need to diagnose the fault or complete a technical inspection before contacting us."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","class","button"],["","href","tel:0413477667"]],[["text","Call 0413 477 667"]]],["text"," "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","class","button service-book-button"],["","href","contact.html?service=hot-water-problems-perth.html"]],[["text","Request a visit & written quote"]]]]]]],["text","
"]]],["text","
