"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","article",[["","class","card"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","span",[["","class","eyebrow"]],[["text","Company update"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","A clearer way to send a property maintenance enquiry"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Keep the address, problem, access and approval information in one place."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","news-clearer-property-maintenance-enquiry.html"]],[["text","Read update →"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","article",[["","class","card"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","span",[["","class","eyebrow"]],[["text","Company update"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","What makes a useful plumbing or electrical work order"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Use observable facts rather than an assumed diagnosis."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","news-useful-property-work-order.html"]],[["text","Read update →"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","article",[["","class","card"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","span",[["","class","eyebrow"]],[["text","Company update"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Keeping access information with the repair request"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Help avoid back-and-forth when a property needs attention."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","news-keeping-access-information-together.html"]],[["text","Read update →"]]]]]]],["comment"," site-intent:start "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","intent-content shell text-column"],["","data-site-intent",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Choose a practical booking note"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The enquiry note covers the first description. The work-order note records assessable tasks and approval limits. The access note keeps the visit arrangements current and private. For fault-specific explanations, use the insights guides instead; these company notes do not replace a technical inspection."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","news-clearer-property-maintenance-enquiry.html"]],[["text","Prepare the initial maintenance enquiry"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","news-useful-property-work-order.html"]],[["text","Define the work-order scope"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","news-keeping-access-information-together.html"]],[["text","Keep repair access information together"]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Which note should a property manager start with?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Start with the enquiry note when the fault is first reported. Use the work-order note when turning that report into an instruction, then the access note to confirm how the agreed visit will take place."]]]]]]],["comment"," site-intent:end "]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section"],["","data-content-hub",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell text-column"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","From a repair request to a clear work order"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","These practical company notes explain how to describe a job, coordinate entry and record approval. Each note covers a different part of the booking process so owners and managers can keep the same property reference from first contact through to the agreed work."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Start with the condition at the property"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Use the initial-enquiry note for the location, affected room and current symptom. Separate a reported fault from an improvement you want quoted, such as a new outlet or appliance connection. For the work itself, our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","plumbing.html"]],[["text","plumbing service overview"]]],["text"," and "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","electrical.html"]],[["text","electrical service overview"]]],["text"," link to the relevant repair and installation pages."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Keep access and approval distinct"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The access note covers entry to the property and equipment, the on-site contact and changed arrangements. The work-order note covers the requested tasks, decision-maker and approval boundaries. An occupant who provides access may not be authorised to approve additional repair costs. Keep private entry codes and keys out of public photos and pages."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","For technical observations, use our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights.html"]],[["text","plumbing and electrical guides"]]],["text",". For a rental, strata or other managed premises, see "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","property-management.html"]],[["text","property management maintenance"]]],["text",". When ready, "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html"]],[["text","send the request"]]],["text"," with the address, current issue and contact details. The written quote confirms the property-specific work; a preparation checklist is not a diagnosis or a fixed-price package."]]]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","footer",[["","class","footer"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Ellis Services Group · 0413 477 667 · maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com · 140 St Georges Terrace, Perth WA 6000"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights.html"]],[["text","Insights"]]],["text"," · "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","faq.html"]],[["text","FAQ"]]],["text"," · Services are provided by appropriately licensed plumbing and electrical tradespeople. Licence details are available on request."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","shell"],["","data-business-identity",""]],[["text","ELLIS SERVICES GROUP PTY LTD · "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","https://abr.business.gov.au/ABN/View?id=645821745"],["","rel","noopener noreferrer"],["","target","_blank"]],[["text","ABN 96 645 821 745"]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","shell"],["","data-confirmed-hours",""]],[["text","Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","mobile-ctas"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","tel:0413477667"]],[["text","Call"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html"]],[["text","Book a repair"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","script",[["","src","site.js"]],[]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","script",[["","src","navigation.js"]],[]],["text","
