"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section service-editorial"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","nav",[["","aria-label","On this service page"],["","class","service-jump-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-work"]],[["text","Services"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-method"]],[["text","Repair & installation"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-quote"]],[["text","Costs & quote"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-faq"]],[["text","FAQs"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-booking"]],[["text","Book a visit"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","aside",[["","class","service-answer"],["","data-service-answer",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","What to do next"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Report which rooms or circuits have lost power and what was happening when the fault appeared. Do not remove covers, touch wiring or investigate wet or damaged equipment. Keep clear of the hazard and arrange an electrical assessment. The electrician identifies the investigation needed before quoting the repair. A loss of power does not automatically mean a switchboard or circuit needs replacement; any extra installation work is explained separately."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-safety-switch-keeps-tripping.html"]],[["text","What to note about power faults and repeated trips"]]],["text",". "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html?service=power-faults-perth.html"]],[["text","Request an assessment and written quote"]]],["text","."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-work"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Electrical fault-finding services for Perth properties"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Loss of power in a room or part of the property"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Tell us whether the problem affects one outlet, several rooms or the whole property. The extent of the loss helps establish the investigation needed, but it does not prove where the fault is. Our electrician assesses the relevant installation and reported symptoms; an issue outside the property installation may require a different responsible party."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Intermittent faults and repeated interruptions"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A circuit that works at some times and fails at others needs the pattern of the interruption considered. Tell us what was in use, whether the issue recurs and any previous work. We use that information to plan the fault investigation, not to ask you to recreate an unsafe fault or open equipment."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Power faults involving protective devices"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A switch tripping can accompany a broader loss-of-power problem, but the protective device is not automatically the faulty part. We assess the installation and explain the identified repair. For enquiries centred on repeated RCD operation, see our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","safety-switch-tripping-perth.html"]],[["text","safety-switch and RCD repair service"]]],["text","."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","figure",[["","class","service-editorial-figure"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","img",[["","alt","Electrical service illustration showing an electrician inspecting a switchboard"],["","class","service-editorial-image"],["","height","941"],["","loading","lazy"],["","sizes","(max-width: 540px) calc(100vw - 48px), 480px"],["","src","electrical-service-perth.png"],["","srcset","electrical-service-perth-480.webp 480w, electrical-service-perth-960.webp 960w"],["","width","1672"]],[]]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-method"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","From electrical investigation to an agreed repair"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Our electrician reviews the affected area, reported events and access to the installation, then carries out the relevant fault investigation. Finding the cause and repairing it are distinct tasks. We explain the findings before agreeing components, connection repairs or additional circuit work, rather than quoting an undefined replacement based only on the enquiry."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Repair scope, access and additional circuit work"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The written quote identifies the proposed repair and any further work needed to reach or correct the fault. A connection repair is a different scope from alterations to the existing wiring. If the investigation identifies an issue outside the original request, we explain it and confirm the scope before extra work proceeds."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","After the approved work, we carry out the relevant checks and explain the completed repair and any remaining issue. One fault-finding visit is not a blanket assessment of every electrical item in the property. For a specific fitting or outlet request, our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","lighting-power-points-perth.html"]],[["text","power-point and lighting services"]]],["text"," provide a more focused service pathway."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-trade-note"]],[["text","Our Perth plumbing and electrical work is carried out by appropriately licensed trades. Licence details are available on request."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-safety"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","strong",[],[["text","Safety:"]]],["text"," Do not remove switchboard covers, handle wiring or repeatedly recreate a fault. Keep clear of damaged, wet or overheating equipment. For immediate danger, Call 000."]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:start "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-content"],["","data-keyword-gap",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","gap-fault-finding-scope"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Electrical fault finding: what the investigation needs to establish"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A useful investigation separates the reported symptom, the part of the installation assessed and the findings from that visit. A fault affecting one outlet is not the same request as loss of power across several rooms. Describe what has already happened without repeatedly operating equipment to reproduce it."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Ask what the initial investigation includes, what further access or testing would need approval and whether the repair is quoted separately. If the fault does not occur during the visit, discuss the findings and any agreed next step rather than treating the absence of a symptom as proof that the whole installation is fault-free."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","safety-switch-tripping-perth.html"]],[["text","Assessment of a repeatedly tripping safety switch"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","lighting-power-points-perth.html"]],[["text","A planned light or outlet installation is a separate task"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","about.html"]],[["text","Business details and privately requested trade documentation"]]]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","learn-about-power-faults-perth"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Electrical fault finding Perth: symptoms and service choices"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Power loss in part of a house"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Different rooms and outlets may use different circuits. A circuit, connection or connected-equipment fault may affect part of the property while other areas work. Report the pattern, but do not assume that working lights prove an affected outlet is safe."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Investigating intermittent power faults"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Yes. Describe when it occurs, affected outlets or lights and any change in equipment use. Intermittent faults may need staged investigation; assessment and repair inclusions are confirmed in the quote rather than promised from a symptom."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-safety-switch-keeps-tripping.html"]],[["text","Safe observations before electrical assessment"]]]]]]]]]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:end "]]]]],["text","
