"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A safety switch that keeps tripping needs an electrical assessment, not an assumed switch replacement. Ellis Services Group provides safety-switch and RCD fault finding and repairs across Perth. Our licensed electrical team investigates the affected installation, explains the repair required and confirms a written quote before the agreed work."]]],["text","
