"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section service-editorial"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","nav",[["","aria-label","On this service page"],["","class","service-jump-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-work"]],[["text","Services"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-method"]],[["text","Repair & installation"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-quote"]],[["text","Costs & quote"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-faq"]],[["text","FAQs"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-booking"]],[["text","Book a visit"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","aside",[["","class","service-answer"],["","data-service-answer",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","What to do next"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A recurring trip is a symptom, not proof that the safety switch needs replacing. Note the affected areas and what was in use when it happened, without dismantling equipment or touching wiring. Keep clear of wet or damaged electrical equipment. We assess the cause and explain the investigation, repair and any separate replacement work in the quote. You do not need to carry out a technical test before booking."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-safety-switch-keeps-tripping.html"]],[["text","Safety switch keeps tripping: what to report"]]],["text",". "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html?service=safety-switch-tripping-perth.html"]],[["text","Request an assessment and written quote"]]],["text","."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-work"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Safety-switch fault finding and RCD repairs"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Repeated tripping or a switch that will not stay on"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Repeated operation of a protective device is a symptom that needs investigation. Tell us which areas have lost power and whether the problem began during normal use or after a change at the property. We assess the relevant circuits and connections without asking you to force the switch on or continue recreating the problem."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Connected equipment and wiring concerns"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The assessment distinguishes a concern involving connected equipment from one involving the fixed installation or protective device. A tripping switch alone does not establish which item is responsible. We explain the investigation findings so the repair targets the identified issue rather than treating a new switch as a universal fix."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Related power interruptions"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","If the problem is broader than a repeatedly tripping safety switch, our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","power-faults-perth.html"]],[["text","electrical fault-finding service"]]],["text"," covers wider power-loss enquiries. You do not need to select a technical diagnosis before booking: describing the affected rooms and observed interruption is enough for the initial request."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","figure",[["","class","service-editorial-figure"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","img",[["","alt","Electrical service illustration showing an electrician inspecting a switchboard"],["","class","service-editorial-image"],["","height","941"],["","loading","lazy"],["","sizes","(max-width: 540px) calc(100vw - 48px), 480px"],["","src","electrical-service-perth.png"],["","srcset","electrical-service-perth-480.webp 480w, electrical-service-perth-960.webp 960w"],["","width","1672"]],[]]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-method"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","How our electrician scopes the RCD repair"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","We begin with the reported pattern, the affected installation and safe access to the electrical equipment. Our electrician investigates the relevant fault and explains whether corrective work concerns a connection, wiring, a device or another identified issue. The written scope reflects those findings rather than the assumption that the switch itself has failed."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Device replacement versus wider electrical work"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Replacement of a protective device and alteration of a circuit are different scopes. We identify any replacement components, additional access and circuit work before asking you to approve the repair. If equipment outside the agreed fixed-wiring scope is involved, we clarify that boundary rather than promising appliance repair as part of the same job."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Following authorised work, we carry out the checks relevant to the repair and explain the outcome and any remaining concerns. Our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-safety-switch-keeps-tripping.html"]],[["text","guide to repeated safety-switch tripping"]]],["text"," explains what information is useful before a visit, but it does not replace the on-site electrical assessment or provide instructions for opening electrical equipment."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-trade-note"]],[["text","Our Perth plumbing and electrical work is carried out by appropriately licensed trades. Licence details are available on request."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-safety"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","strong",[],[["text","Safety:"]]],["text"," Do not bypass a protective device, hold a switch on or remove electrical covers. Stay away from wet or damaged electrical equipment. For immediate danger, Call 000."]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:start "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-content"],["","data-keyword-gap",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","gap-rcd-testing"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","RCD testing enquiries versus a tripping-switch repair"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Our safety-switch page covers fault assessment and the agreed repair. A request for scheduled RCD testing, an instrument test or a register for managed premises has a different purpose. Explain the site, equipment and record required so the team can confirm whether that scope is available."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Keep a reported trip separate from a periodic inspection instruction. If you need a specific report, agree its contents and the circuits or devices included before booking. Do not assume that replacing one device certifies the installation, or that a generic repair visit includes every requested compliance document."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","power-faults-perth.html"]],[["text","Investigation of a broader power fault"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","smoke-alarm-maintenance-perth.html#gap-smoke-alarm-testing"]],[["text","Separate smoke-alarm maintenance and testing requests"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","property-management.html"]],[["text","Work-order approval and document requirements"]]]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","learn-about-safety-switch-tripping-perth"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Safety switch tripping Perth: symptoms and service choices"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","RCD and circuit-breaker protection"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","An RCD responds to a current imbalance associated with leakage; a circuit breaker protects against overload or short circuit. Combined devices may provide both functions. The device and fault need assessment; do not bypass protection or repeatedly reset it."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Possible causes of safety-switch tripping"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","No. A circuit or connected appliance may be responsible. Rain-related trips and trips during washing-machine use are observations to report, not proof of a particular failed component."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-safety-switch-keeps-tripping.html"]],[["text","Understanding recurring trips safely"]]]]]]]]]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:end "]]]]],["text","
