"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Arrange toilet repairs in Perth for leaks, running cisterns, slow filling, flush faults, blockages or overflow. Ellis Services Group carries out an on-site assessment, explains the repair plan and confirms a written quote. Our plumbing team distinguishes toilet-component repairs from drainage work so the job addresses the reported problem."]]],["text","
