"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Arrange water leak detection and plumbing repair in Perth with Ellis Services Group. We investigate suspected hidden leaks, visible pipe leaks and leaking connections, then explain the access and repair work required. Our local team provides a property-specific repair plan and written quote rather than treating every damp patch as the same fault."]]],["text","
