"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section service-editorial"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","nav",[["","aria-label","On this service page"],["","class","service-jump-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-work"]],[["text","Services"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-method"]],[["text","Repair & installation"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-quote"]],[["text","Costs & quote"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-faq"]],[["text","FAQs"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#service-booking"]],[["text","Book a visit"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","aside",[["","class","service-answer"],["","data-service-answer",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","What to do next"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A damp patch does not by itself identify a failed pipe. Record where water appears, when it happens and whether it is spreading, from a safe position. Keep clear of water near wiring or electrical fittings; do not open walls to find the source. We assess the suspected leak and explain detection, access and repair as distinct parts of the quote. Replacement finishes and other restoration are included only when the written scope says so."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-reporting-a-plumbing-leak.html"]],[["text","How to report a suspected plumbing leak"]]],["text",". "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html?service=water-leak-detection-perth.html"]],[["text","Request an assessment and written quote"]]],["text","."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-work"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Leak detection and plumbing repairs for Perth properties"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Visible pipe and connection leaks"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Water around a connection, fixture or accessible pipe gives us a useful starting point but does not always show the full path of the leak. We assess the affected plumbing and surrounding area before setting the repair scope. Tell us whether the leak is constant, occurs during use or has changed since you first noticed it."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Suspected leaks behind finishes or in concealed plumbing"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Dampness, recurring moisture and unexplained water around a property need a source investigation before repair access is agreed. We distinguish what is visible from what still needs checking. Opening walls, flooring or another finished surface is not assumed as part of every detection job; the reason and proposed access are discussed with you."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Leaks at bathroom and kitchen fixtures"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A leak can involve a tap, flexible connection, supply pipe or drainage connection. Identifying the relevant component helps separate a fixture repair from concealed pipework. For a leak clearly centred on the fitting, our "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html"]],[["text","tap and mixer repair service"]]],["text"," explains that scope; an active damaged pipe belongs with "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","burst-pipe-repair-perth.html"]],[["text","burst pipe repairs"]]],["text","."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","figure",[["","class","service-editorial-figure"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","img",[["","alt","Tradesperson checking a laundry plumbing connection"],["","class","service-editorial-image"],["","height","941"],["","loading","lazy"],["","sizes","(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1000px) 50vw, 380px"],["","src","plumbing-leak-perth.png"],["","srcset","plumbing-leak-perth-480.webp 480w, plumbing-leak-perth-800.webp 800w, plumbing-leak-perth-1200.webp 1200w"],["","width","1672"]],[]]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","service-editorial-part"],["","id","service-method"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","From locating the source to agreeing the leak repair"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Our plumber reviews the symptoms, accessible plumbing and the pattern of water use associated with the leak. We explain the investigation needed to narrow down the source. The work required to find a leak and the work required to repair it can be different tasks, particularly when the affected pipe is not exposed."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Access, repair and reinstatement are separate decisions"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Once the source and access requirements are established, we explain the affected section or connection, the proposed repair and any additional work. The quote identifies the agreed plumbing scope and whether access or reinstatement is included. Do not assume that replacement finishes, painting or other building work are part of the plumbing repair unless stated."]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Following the approved work, we check the repaired connection or section and explain the outcome of the visit. We discuss any further moisture investigation or follow-up identified during the assessment, so the plumbing repair and any separate building work have a clear next step. Any additional work is explained and quoted before you approve it."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-trade-note"]],[["text","Our Perth plumbing and electrical work is carried out by appropriately licensed trades. Licence details are available on request."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[["","class","service-safety"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","strong",[],[["text","Safety:"]]],["text"," Keep away from water near electrical fittings or wiring. Do not open a wall or remove equipment covers to investigate. For immediate danger, Call 000."]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:start "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-content"],["","data-keyword-gap",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","gap-leak-findings"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Leak detection and repair: keep the findings with the quote"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Describe the visible water and when it changes, then ask the assessment to distinguish the observed source from anything still uncertain. A damp mark is useful context, not proof of a failed pipe or a particular detection method. The proposed approach depends on the suspected location and safe access."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","When reviewing the repair, separate investigation, opening finishes, the plumbing work and any restoration. If records or photographs are needed for the owner or managing agent, agree that requirement before booking. This does not guarantee an insurance outcome, a non-invasive result or a fixed detection accuracy."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","insights-reporting-a-plumbing-leak.html"]],[["text","Report a suspected leak clearly"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","burst-pipe-repair-perth.html"]],[["text","Repair of a known damaged pipe"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","about.html"]],[["text","Who is arranging the work and how to request relevant documents"]]]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","keyword-gap-part"],["","id","learn-about-water-leak-detection-perth"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Water leak detection Perth: symptoms and service choices"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Hidden leaks and higher water bills"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Yes. Water may escape where it is not readily visible, but a higher bill can also reflect changed use or other factors. Compare the timing and report meter observations; investigation is needed before attributing the bill to a concealed pipe leak."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Water-meter movement without expected use"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Unexpected flow may indicate a leak or equipment still drawing water, including a running cistern. It does not by itself identify an underground leak. Follow Water Corporation guidance for meter concerns and arrange assessment of private plumbing where appropriate."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","https://www.watercorporation.com.au/help-and-advice/water-issues/leaks/leaking-meter"]],[["text","Water Corporation meter-leak guidance"]]]]]]]]]]],["comment"," keyword-gap:end "]]]]],["text","
