                confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.
              "]]],["text","
            "]]],["text","
          "]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","What your written quote covers"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The position of the suspected leak, the available access and whether the affected pipe or connection is exposed determine the investigation and repair scope. We distinguish the work needed to locate the source from the repair and any access or reinstatement work included in the written quote."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","The final written quote sets out the work included, materials and any agreed additional tasks. We explain changes to the scope before extra work proceeds. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","contact.html?service=water-leak-detection-perth.html"]],[["text","Request a water leak detection and repair quote"]]],["text","."]]]]]]],["text","
"],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","section",[["","class","section faq service-editorial-faq"],["","id","service-faq"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","shell service-reading"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h2",[],[["text","Water Leak Detection Perth FAQs"]]],["comment"," site-intent:start "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","div",[["","class","intent-content"],["","data-site-intent",""]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","h3",[],[["text","Finding the source before choosing the repair"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","A concealed leak, a leaking tap and water entering from another building element can look similar from the surface. Tell us when the damp area changes and which nearby fixtures are used. Detection, opening-up, plumbing repair and restoring finishes are separate decisions in the written scope."]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","ul",[["","class","intent-links"]],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html"]],[["text","Leaks at taps and mixers"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","burst-pipe-repair-perth.html"]],[["text","Repairing a known damaged pipe"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","shower-plumbing-repairs-perth.html"]],[["text","Shower Plumbing Leak Repairs Perth"]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","li",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","water-pressure-perth.html"]],[["text","Low Water Pressure & Water Hammer Perth"]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Can you guarantee finding a hidden leak without opening a wall?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Access and the suspected source determine what investigation is appropriate. Do not assume that every leak can be located or repaired without opening finishes. The proposed method and any access or restoration work need to be explained before approval."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Does a high water bill prove there is a leaking pipe?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","No. It is useful context, not a diagnosis. Include any observed water, changes in use and available records. If the concern is at the water meter or supply network, use Water Corporation guidance rather than assuming it is private pipework."]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Can a hidden water leak cause a high bill without visible water damage?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Yes, a concealed leak is possible without visible damage. A bill increase alone is insufficient to diagnose one. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#learn-about-water-leak-detection-perth"]],[["text","Read the explanation."]]]]]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Why is my water meter moving when no water is being used?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","p",[],[["text","Flow without expected use can indicate a leak or a fixture still drawing water. It cannot locate the source. "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","a",[["","href","#learn-about-water-leak-detection-perth"]],[["text","Read the explanation."]]]]]]]]],["comment"," site-intent:end "],["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","details",[],[["element","http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml","summary",[],[["text","Do I need to diagnose the problem first?"]]],["element","http://www.w3.or